  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "It is natural",
     "texto": [
      "To say that something is normal or logical to happen, use **-기 마련이다**: 실수하다 → **실수하기 마련이다** (it is normal to make mistakes), 어렵다 → **어렵기 마련이다** (it is natural for it to be difficult).",
      "처음에는 어렵**기 마련이에요** = at first it is natural for it to be difficult."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Result from continuing",
     "texto": [
      "**-다 보니(까)** presents a result or discovery that happened while an action or situation was going on: 공부하**다 보니까** 한 시간이 지났어요 = while studying, an hour went by. It does not require that the person was distracted.",
      "**-다 보면** puts forward a possible result; **-다 보니(까)** tells of the result already observed."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
